# This file pins the bundled libvips release consumed by the native build jobs.
#
# The value must be the tag of a GitHub Release in this repository produced by
# the `Prebuild libvips` workflow (.github/workflows/prebuild-vips.yml). That
# release carries vips-<platform>.tar.gz and matching .sha256 files, ready to
# extract into native/dist/vips-<platform>/. PDF loading stays in JPDFium's
# core bridge; the vips bundles do not include PDFium or GPL poppler/fftw.
#
# Format: vips-YYYYMMDD-<shortSha>
# Example: vips-20260927-abcdef0
#
# The pinned release must contain every platform required by the publishing
# workflows, including both Linux glibc architectures built on Ubuntu 24.04.

vips-20261109-9a3d94b
